# ytdlp-ui
===
 A simple desktop app for yt-dlp. Download YouTube videos, playlists and music from 1000+ sites, convert your own files, and separate vocals, drums and bass. Queue, quality picker, subtitles, chapters and automatic yt-dlp updates. Built with Tauri and React.
